		"description": "<p dir=\"ltr\">Finally at level 1, whenever you finish a long rest, choose one of the following two options:</p><h2>Path of the Light</h2><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Until you finish a long rest, you gain an expertise die in Persuasion and your passive Perception score increases by an amount equal to your Intelligence modifier (minimum 1).</p><h2>Path of the Dark</h2><p>Until you finish a long rest, you gain an expertise die in Deception and darkvision with a range of 60 feet. If you already have darkvision, its range increases by 60 feet instead.</p>",
